What "port to Python" means (lexphon/extraction/ipa_respell.py, or a small
lexphon/respell/ package, exposing ipa_to_canonical_respell(ipa: str) -> str):

1. mappings.ts -> a data table. One IpaSymbol per phoneme: {ipa, canonical
   respelling, category (vowel/glide/liquid/nasal/fricative/affricate/stop),
   sonority, support (english | safe-alias | reference-foreign)}. Mechanical:
   reproduce as a Python dataclass + dict, derive phonemeChunks (longest-first,
   length marks stripped) and ignoredSymbols (tie bars U+0361/U+035C + hyphen).
   Do NOT reuse lexphon/extraction/_ipac_table.py — that is the IPAc-en dialect
   -> IPA table; this is a different IPA -> English respelling table.

2. parser.ts -> tokenizer. Reproduce faithfully, including the subtle parts:
   - unicodedata.normalize('NFD', ipa) first.
   - cleanIpa: strip the outer parens only when they wrap the whole input, then
     remove ignored symbols (tie bars, hyphen).
   - Token-consumer priority order = parenthesis, stress (ˈ primary / ˌ
     secondary), boundary (space or period), literal (/ [ ]), syllabicity
     diacritics (U+030D/U+0329 syllabic; U+032F non-syllabic), longest-match
     phoneme (skip a r-colored vowel chunk when the next segment is a vowel),
     then ignored phonetic marks (ː ʰ ˑ).
   - matchCandidateAt skips an interleaved length mark 'ː' while still matching
     the rest of the chunk (this is what cleanly handles ɑː, uː, etc.); carry it
     over verbatim.
   - Errors mirror upstream: unknown symbol -> raise naming the offending symbol;
     unclosed optional group / unmatched ')' -> raise.

3. syllabifier.ts -> boundary inference. Port LEGAL_ONSET_CLUSTERS,
   NON_ONSET_PHONEMES (ŋ, ɴ, ŋk), ONSET_EQUIVALENTS (ɡ->g, ɹ/ɾ/ɽ/ʁ->r, ɫ->l),
   isVowel/isNucleus (explicit syllabicity flag wins, else category=='vowel'),
   then maximal-onset boundary placement across nuclei with region breaks at
   stress/boundary/literal tokens.

4. converter.ts -> convert(). Walk tokens, accumulate a current syllable,
   uppercase the syllable following a primary stress (secondary stress ends the
   pending capitalization but emits no marker), explicit boundary -> space,
   optional group -> literal '(' / ')' preserved, literals preserved, then strip
   empty '()' groups. Straightforward.

